        "runId": "ada-en-mw8vshb5-enc7ju",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "This itinerary brings together two different trips. You'll spend almost two weeks in mainland Ecuador, riding the cable car above Quito, walking through the cloud forests of Mindo, trekking for five days in the Central Andes and rafting the Quijos River. You'll also visit the waterfalls of Baños, the Chimborazo reserve, Ingapirca and Cajas National Park. Then the trip continues in the Galápagos Islands."
